COMM 39K(p,gamma)40Ca three-step gamma cascade scan -- 2D grid of two
COMM fictional intermediate levels, terminating at the TRUE GROUND
COMM STATE. Same beam/target/recoil/resonance physics as
COMM reactions/k39pg_40ca.reaction (see that file for the full
COMM mass/kinematics derivation) and the same single-level scan
COMM convention as reactions/k39pg_40ca_cascade_*.reaction (see any of
COMM those for that series' own derivation) -- this series just adds a
COMM second intermediate level above the first. Cascade: resonance ->
COMM Level2 -> Level1 -> ground, three gammas per event (100% branching
COMM at each step, no other decay path). Resonance excitation above
COMM ground: Ex = Q + Er = 8.32777 + 0.606 = 8.93377 MeV. Level1 ranges
COMM 0.1 MeV up to (Level2's own cap minus 0.1 MeV); Level2 ranges from
COMM (Level1 + 0.1 MeV) up to 8.8 MeV (Ex - 0.1 MeV, rounded down to the
COMM 0.1 MeV grid) -- the same cap the single-level series itself used.
COMM
COMM THIS FILE: Level1 = 5.1000 MeV, Level2 = 5.9000 MeV (both
COMM absolute excitation above ground). Gamma energies (before
COMM recoil-kinematics corrections, which this pilot's
COMM ReactionKinematics does apply): gamma1 = Ex - Level2 = 3.0338 MeV
COMM (resonance -> Level2), gamma2 = Level2 - Level1 = 0.8000 MeV
COMM (Level2 -> Level1), gamma3 = Level1 = 5.1000 MeV (Level1 ->
COMM ground). Every event emits exactly three gammas -- verify with
COMM `--reaction-stats <this file>`.
COMM
COMM Both intermediate levels' lifetimes below are placeholders
COMM (1e-12 s), fictional like the levels themselves and unused by the
COMM kinematics (see ReactionConfig.hh's own LEVL card comment: this
COMM pilot's cascade is instantaneous-at-vertex, not a real modeled
COMM flight time).

BEAM 19  39   -33.8072      # Z A massExcessMeV -- 39K
TARG 1   1    7.28897       # 1H (target, at rest)
RECL 20  40   -34.8460   8  # 40Ca, placeholder charge state (see k39pg_40ca.reaction)
ERES 0.606                  # CM resonance energy above threshold, MeV

LEVL   1   5.1000   1.0E-12   # fictional lower intermediate level
LEVL   2   5.9000   1.0E-12   # fictional upper intermediate level

BRAT   -1  100.0   2        # resonance -> upper intermediate, 100%
BRAT    2  100.0   1        # upper intermediate -> lower intermediate, 100%
BRAT    1  100.0   0        # lower intermediate -> ground, 100%
SENT
